  "textBlocks": [
    "Hello Bravehearts\nLast week we started to \nlook at wearing God’s Armour",
    "STORY TIME",
    "CRAFT & GAME TIME \nMAKE A SWORD & BLOW UP 3 BALLOONS - SEE PICTURES BELOW\nWARNING : BALLOONS CAN BE VERY DANGEROUS \nIF POPPED PIECES ARE SWALLOWED.\nWHEN YOUR BALLOONS POP \nPLEASE PICK UP ALL THE PIECES AND THROW AWAY",
    "SONG TIME",
    "PRAYER TIME\nThank you Lord Jesus for giving us the Bible\nI want to be in your army\nPlease help me to read my Bible and learn all about you\nAmen",
